xt-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Le canard</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">The duck</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Le canard","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234568,"_nanoseconds":97000000}},{"id":"slaM9rCfylMlG2PXHOhW","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":8,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l08-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Le cheval</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">The horse</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Le cheval","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234568,"_nanoseconds":100000000}},{"id":"fhZGOTqlzi6YB4U5QGAK","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":8,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l08-p07-b1","partTitle":"Say it 5/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Qu'est-ce que c'est ?</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">What is it?</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Qu'est-ce que c'est ?","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234568,"_nanoseconds":137000000}},{"id":"w8u6TlYJKfRJmfXnNLA5","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":8,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l08-p08-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Bonjour ! Ça va ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello! How are you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Ça va bien ! Et toi ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm good! And you?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Très bien. Regarde, qu'est-ce que c'est ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Very good. Look, what is it?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>C'est une vache !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's a cow!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Oui ! Elle est noire et blanche.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes! She is black and white.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Et ça, qu'est-ce que c'est ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And that, what is it?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>C'est un cochon rose.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's a pink pig.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Un cochon rose ! Super !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">A pink pig! Great!</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Combien de canards ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">How many ducks?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Trois canards !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Three ducks!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234568,"_nanoseconds":305000000}},{"id":"dN5kDy0Hg4My0QOhpJhF","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":8,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l08-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Bonjour ! Ç